 141:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdapistd.c ****  * The return value will be the number of lines actually read.
 142:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdapistd.c ****  * This may be less than the number requested in several cases,
 143:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdapistd.c ****  * including bottom of image, data source suspension, and operating
 144:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdapistd.c ****  * modes that emit multiple scanlines at a time.
 145:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdapistd.c ****  *
 146:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdapistd.c ****  * Note: we warn about excess calls to jpeg_read_scanlines() since
 147:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdapistd.c ****  * this likely signals an application programmer error.  However,
 148:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdapistd.c ****  * an oversize buffer (max_lines > scanlines remaining) is not an error.
 149:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdapistd.c ****  */
